# verify-accept -- pkg verify findings accepted on a system installed from
# the OI Mac r1 medium; read by verify-check.sh.  One finding per line:
#	package|action: path|error
# Nothing else is accepted.  Made from the v10d install (2026-11-22).
#
# desktop/shared-mime-info, usr/share/mime: DC's
#   slimcd_pre_boot_archive_pkg_image_mod runs the mime-types-cache method
#   in the image; update-mime-database writes the tree again as root:root
#   0644, and the caches and six XML files with other content (they cover
#   the MIME types of all packages in the image).
# system/boot/loader, boot/cdboot: DC's create_iso runs mkisofs with
#   -boot-info-table, which writes the table into that file in the image.
#
# print/cups, var/cache/cups (expected 0775, found 0770): cupsd sets 0770
#   itself when it starts; OI's manifest is wrong, plain OI fails the same.
#   Known issue of r1, upstream fix in notes/oi-mac-r1-upstream/.
# system/boot/real-mode, boot/solaris/bootenv.rc (expected root:sys, found
#   root:root): the installer (ICT) writes it again by rename and loses the
#   group; plain OI the same.  Known issue of r1, upstream fix as above.
#
